# Commit and push

When a change in this repo is finished and checked, commit it and push `main`. Do not ask first.

- Leave the untracked experiments out: `bench_vm_size.sh`, `serve_windy.py`, `site/windy.html`, `site/zoom.html`.
- Do not commit secrets. Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks.
- After a push, run `./mirror_to_dropbox.sh` so the Dropbox copy matches GitHub.
